    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just \"self-doubt.\" i've always been the one they could count on. the one who gets the honors, the one who makes them proud. now that i've messed up this badly, there's nothing left to go back to. i feel like the person they loved doesn't even exist anymore. i'm just a hollow shell of who i was.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
